OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785925100
OL,3,CPolice offer #20,000 reward in
OL,4,CPrimrose Hill stabbing investigation
OL,6,FDetectives investigating the fatal
OL,7,Fstabbing of a 21-year-old student in a
OL,8,Fnorth London park have offered a
OL,9,F#20,000 reward for information on the
OL,10,Fwhereabouts of a man they "urgently
OL,11,Fwish to trace".
OL,13,FThe Metropolitan Police have also
OL,14,Fappealed directly to 22-year-old
OL,15,Fsuspect Jordan Asije, urging him to
OL,16,F"do the right thing" and hand himself
OL,17,Fin.
OL,19,FThe force released a picture of Mr
OL,20,FAsije on Tuesday morning, adding he is
OL,21,Fknown to frequent north London.
OL,26,@rD@[OUsD@NO]xD@AOUxD@TO]
