OL,3,CPolice offer #20,000 reward in
OL,4,CPrimrose Hill stabbing investigation
OL,6,FFinbar Sullivan, a filmmaking student,
OL,7,Fwas stabbed to death during a fight in
OL,8,FPrimrose Hill in the early evening on
OL,9,FTuesday April 7.
OL,11,FAnother man in his 20s also suffered
OL,12,Finjuries, which were not life-
OL,13,Fthreatening or life-changing, police
OL,14,Fsaid.
OL,16,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,17,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,18,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,19,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/6
