OL,3,CPolice offer #20,000 reward in
OL,4,CPrimrose Hill stabbing investigation
OL,6,FDetective Inspector Andy Griffin, who
OL,7,Fis leading the investigation, said:
OL,8,F"Jordan, if you are reading this, I
OL,9,Furge you to do the right thing and
OL,10,Fhand yourself in at the nearest police
OL,11,Fstation.
OL,13,F"I also want to make it clear that
OL,14,Fanyone knowingly assisting Jordan to
OL,15,Fevade arrest, or harbouring him, may
OL,16,Fbe committing a criminal offence and
OL,17,Fcan expect to be investigated and
OL,18,Fdealt with robustly."
OL,26,@pD@AOUuD@AOUzD@UO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/6
