OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785925100
OL,3,CPolice offer #20,000 reward in
OL,4,CPrimrose Hill stabbing investigation
OL,6,FThe Met said Mr Asije is not believed
OL,7,Fto pose a threat to the public but
OL,8,Fadded that he should not be approached.
OL,10,FAnyone who sees him should call police
OL,11,Fon 999 instead, or call 101 quoting
OL,12,Freference CAD 6448/07APR26.
OL,14,FMr Griffin added: "My thoughts remain
OL,15,Fwith Finbar's family following their
OL,16,Ftruly devastating loss.
OL,18,F"We have made significant progress in
OL,19,Funderstanding the events that led to
OL,20,Fhis tragic death and our enquiries
OL,21,Fcontinue.
OL,26,@vD@SOUzD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/6
