OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,375,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F374A1785925100
OL,3,CPolice offer #20,000 reward in
OL,4,CPrimrose Hill stabbing investigation
OL,6,F"As part of this work, a reward of up
OL,7,Fto #20,000 is now being offered to
OL,8,Fencourage the public to help us arrest
OL,9,Feveryone we believe was involved in
OL,10,Fthe murder.
OL,12,F"No piece of information is too small
OL,13,Fand what may appear insignificant to
OL,14,Fyou, could prove vital to our
OL,15,Fenquiries."
OL,17,FThree men ` 27-year-old Oliuwadamilola
OL,18,FOgunyankinnu, 25-year-old Alexis
OL,19,FBidace, and Ernest Boateng, also 25 `
OL,20,Fhave already been charged with Mr
OL,21,FSullivan's murder.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@AOUwD@KO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/6
